A bad keystroke _can_ end the game, and is part of the game.  What if
for example, you needed to quaff a potion of full healing but instead
you quaffed a potion of confusion?  Or ate your cockatrice corpse
instead of a food ration?  The fact is, you have to be careful with
certain actions in the game and working with your bag of holding is
one of those times.  Fortunately, you didn't lose everything!  If
you're only a few levels below Soko then there's a whole dungeon of
loot left, not to mention the Wand of Wishing.

Oh by the way, while this accomplishment may have taken you 2 weeks,
if you work at it you will eventually be getting to the same place in
your game within a few hours.  So take heart!

